The quality of the toy is good, but I have to complain about the packaging.
I received the package yesterday; it was bought from Amazon and was labeled as being shipped via EMS. However, in the end, it was delivered by Tmall’s courier service. How many different delivery routes were involved in this process? Do Amazon and Tmall have a good relationship with each other?
Let’s talk about the packaging again: The toy was wrapped in several layers of plastic wrap, and there wasn’t even any protective plastic bubble wrap inside. When I opened it, all the parts were simply placed in an empty box. Fortunately, the quality of the toy itself was good; no parts were damaged. However, the toy is much smaller than I expected. Since it doesn’t come with batteries, it tends to derail frequently when being pushed around by hand. I also feel that the gaps on both sides of the track are too large, indicating that the design is not well thought out.
The goods are quite good.
First of all, I want to mention that I just bought the computer a few days ago and immediately noticed a price reduction. The review I wanted to write was negative – although the computer itself was fairly good and offered great value for money. The CPU and GPU are sufficient for playing mainstream online games as well as a considerable number of large-scale single-player games. The cooling system is also very effective. However, the screen has some light leakage (a common issue with IPS screens), and the sound quality is not very good. The hard drive is also not up to par (it’s recommended to spend extra money on a solid-state drive). Yesterday, I took the computer to the after-sales service for a hardware check, and no issues were found. The pre-installed Windows 8.1 is not very user-friendly; it’s recommended to upgrade to Windows 10. The seller shipped the product quickly and responded promptly to all my inquiries. The invoice arrived the very day after I received the computer, which is quite nice. Unfortunately, there were no gifts included in the package.
(By the way, when buying keyboard stickers, definitely don’t buy from a store on Taobao called Eku Digital Center. The delivery is slow, the quality is poor, and if there are problems with the products, they won’t be refunded or replaced. The owner also uses a lot of foul language. I’m just exposing this shop specifically.)
You adulterer!
When I made the purchase, the promotional page stated that a copy of the “The Three-Body Problem” series would be given for free upon spending 99 yuan. However, when the product arrived, the bonus was not included. I called customer service and was asked to provide a screenshot of the promotional page from that time. The question is: who buys something and also saves a screenshot of the web page? It’s your own promotional campaign—you should already have all the necessary evidence. All buyers should be more cautious in the future and make sure to save proof of their purchases.
I advise everyone not to waste their money needlessly.
I first purchased this product with great expectations, thinking that the Lele brand shouldn’t be that bad. Upon receiving it, the packaging looked decent, and the size was also acceptable. However, almost all the fruits in one box were soft; this couldn’t be detected just by looking at them – you had to feel them with your hands. When I tasted them, there was absolutely no flavor at all; they were bland and tasteless. Upon biting into them, the flesh inside was a dark yellow color, indicating that the fruits were spoiled. The box contained both good and bad fruits, and less than one-third of the contents were actually edible. I advise everyone not to buy this product – it’s not only expensive but also of extremely poor quality!
From this experience, I’ve learned my lesson: I will never buy fruits online again!
The quality of the pictures is simply unacceptable.
As a book with a title like “Ancient Atlas”, the quality of the images selected, the way they are arranged, and the printing process are simply unacceptable. Some of the images are even mosaic-like and so blurred that they are impossible to recognize.
Even if this book is not a professional atlas, and even if the illustrations are of small size, they should still be in line with the extensive range of medieval documents left by our ancestors as listed in the table of contents!
(Moreover, many of the images can be obtained in high-quality original form from relevant industry resources.) What's the difference between using such images to compile a book and not using any images at all?
I am sorry for this kind of academic spirit.
The article is written in a language that is not judged, but each party has its own opinion.
Overall 2 stars.
Good shopping
East and West both highly recommend!
I still believe in Amazon’s own products; now that we can buy overseas, it is convenient to get things shipped back from abroad and the shipping time is just a few days longer than domestic shipments. I have no doubt about Amazon’s ability to clear customs for us when buying overseas goods, which is much faster than going through a third-party carrier. Therefore, many people are turning to Amazon’s Overseas Shopping service to purchase items online.
I hope the quality and price of domestic products can be better. Many things are made in China, but it’s actually cheaper to buy them abroad than to buy them locally. I hope they can make some improvements.
I bought something that had already been opened by someone else.
It’s indeed quite high to have to pay over a hundred in taxes for more than 300 machines. Now that it’s down to just over 600 machines, I feel much more satisfied.
When I received it, the seal tape looked suspiciously damaged, as if the package had been opened. I quickly took a photo, and sure enough, the package tore open easily upon being opened. The cardboard inside was also damaged. I was worried that someone else had returned the product, and since the anniversary date hadn’t even arrived yet, I decided to try using it with my husband right away. Unfortunately, the machine didn’t have any power at all. Fortunately, there were no food particles stuck in the blade; otherwise, who would want to go through the hassle of returning such a product from such a distance?
It’s still unknown whether it will work well or if there will be any problems in the short term. As mentioned in previous reviews, the products sent out when the item is out of stock are definitely not reliable!
Overall satisfaction
I was initially worried about the packaging of the camera, but this time it was fine. There was an inflatable bag inside, and the camera matched the size specified (size 3). It can also be registered on the official website; the number of shutter releases is 0. For everything else, we’ll have to wait and see how it performs over time.
The delivery speed was quite fast. I’d like to complain about the courier: the valuable items were just left at the entrance, and the courier left immediately. I couldn’t open the packages and check their contents in front of him, which really frustrates me.
Too small; no umbrella cover available; the material is just average.
It's not a big number at all!
The second Tote umbrella: 1. It doesn’t come with a rain cover. 2. The material of the umbrella handle is of average quality. 3. Although it’s labeled as “Large”, it’s actually just a small, portable umbrella designed for one person to use; it might barely be enough for two people.
On the contrary, the one I bought from Amazon earlier can be used by three people without any problems at all.
The products are okay, but the after-sales service on Amazon is really much worse than on other websites.
After placing the order, I realized I had made a mistake. However, I was unable to cancel the order. When I tried to contact the online customer service via the website, I kept getting directed to broken links, and I couldn’t get in touch with them.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
The only thing that is said when you request a refund is that the food category cannot be returned once the order is received, and there is no way to call Amazon customer service, which is the same as saying that the order cannot be returned.
I have previously bought items on JD.com and Suning that were not eligible for return due to company policies, including milk and diapers. I contacted customer service, and the products were still refunded. Even for the diapers from JD.com, which had a strong odor after being opened, the refund was granted upon contacting customer service. However, this doesn’t work the same way on Amazon.
The rules are fixed, but people are living; I contacted your customer service to ask how this situation will be handled.
Tell me to either keep it for myself or let the delivery person buy it themselves. The delivery person already has a tough job; why should I make them pay for something that wasn’t purchased by me?
Okay, I won't back out either; I'll take it myself and give you one star for your service.
The headphones have a bias in sound quality, as well as background noise.
This pair of headphones is rubbish; I don't know if it's my ears that have gone bad or if these headphones really aren't as good as they used to be.
I bought a blue one from that store two years ago; the sound quality was quite good, with no noise or issues with the bass. It lasted for over two years before it broke down, so I plan to buy another one (the Urban Beats model) since I still think it’s a decent option.
I saw another purple one that looked really nice, so I bought it. But when I opened it today and listened to it, something seemed off: one side of the device produced a loud sound, while the other side produced a low sound.
At first, I thought it was just due to the sound effects of that particular song and didn’t give it much thought. But after listening to them for a while, I realized that the problem was quite serious. Not only was there a noticeable pitch distortion, but the bass performance also wasn’t as good as it used to be. There was also some background noise. Is this phenomenon only present in the purple version I bought, or has the quality of headphone manufacturing really declined nowadays?
Quite poor reviews; I’m very disappointed.
The return must be made tomorrow during the day.
PS looks good.
Products like this should not appear on Amazon's own platform (Amazon Direct).
The product is very good, it is not cheap, and it is also very good to read the reviews.
When I actually received the product, I was stunned: the surface of the item had extensive wear and tear, and there were signs of wear in many other areas as well. It’s either a defective product or an old one; I’ll upload pictures later.
I applied for a return, and the person from the manufacturer said that the issue was caused by transportation after seeing the pictures. Isn’t that just nonsense?
How could the interior of the product get worn out in any way?
There are only two possibilities: either it’s a defective or used product, or I deliberately damaged the item and then returned it for a refund.
In objective terms, I do not have evidence to prove that I did not damage the product, but based on my credit record for shopping on Amazon, I believe such products should not be included in Amazon's own goods; customer choice is trust, and we all win. Customer victory is also the victory of the manufacturer. Let us work together to improve this situation, thank you.
The watch is very satisfactory
It’s definitely a genuine product; I’ve checked it at the official store. The watch has a beautiful appearance, exquisite craftsmanship, and is made with high-quality materials. Additionally, it features an imported mechanical movement, which gives it significant weight and quality that can’t be matched by those so-called “mechanical watches” that cost only three or four hundred yuan. This one is truly authentic and of superior quality.
The accuracy of the watch’s timekeeping is very high; the error is completely within an acceptable range. The watch comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate in its packaging. The 12 o’clock mark on the dial is made of genuine diamonds. It’s perfect to wear yourself, and it would also make a great gift that impresses others.
The Bentley is really good.
It's good on both sides.
The product is really good; I bought it as a gift for my girlfriend. However, I had some trouble at noon when the Canadian courier service was unavailable. The logistics company simply left the package in the “Mail Storage” service without sending me a verification message regarding the pick-up, which forced me to make two trips.
But the baby is really nice indeed.
It’s the genuine product, and it’s well-packaged.
The packaging is complete, with an inflatable bag inside, and there are no online reviews, only a glowing look of a product.
There is also a layer of plastic wrap on the outer packaging of the bottle, just as described in the picture. The delivery was very fast too; it arrived the very next day after I took the photo.
It’s the genuine product; it’s just out of stock, and we don’t know when it will be available again.
It looks very good.
I had my eye on this camera a long time ago, but I didn’t buy it due to some other reasons besides the price. This time, since the price was reasonable enough when taking advantage of the free shipping offer for buying multiple items together, I decided to go ahead and purchase it.
After making the purchase, there were no issues with anything else. However, when trying to connect the device via software, it simply wouldn’t connect. I use a TP router at home. After searching online, I found that many people were experiencing the same problem. I spent over two hours trying various methods to adjust the router’s settings. Finally, I managed to get it connected by using 360WIFI as a intermediary. During that time, I also called Xiaomi’s customer service, but they didn’t have any solutions to this issue and suggested that I contact Amazon for after-sales support.
Another point worth noting is that I saw comments from users online stating that the minimum size of the memory card supported by this camera is 8GB; any memory card with a smaller capacity will not be recognized. I hope everyone takes this into consideration.
It feels good to use it, but the picture quality is still acceptable, but the audio quality is very poor. The machine has some degree of heat generation, and if you keep it on for a long time, it feels like this level of heat is somewhat difficult to accept.
In summary, this product still has many shortcomings, and I hope everyone will be cautious when purchasing it.
Light and large capacity
I like its lightweight design and the large opening. However, the two separate compartments seem a bit unnecessary to me; I don’t really know what to put in them.
After buying it, I found that there was another brand similar one on Overseas Shopping (Meizu) for less than two hundred yuan.
Amazon shipping issues
Upon receiving the goods and conducting an inspection, it was found that:
1. The table packaging is in a very poor state of repair (it’s severely damaged).
2. The instruction manual for the table has severe signs of wear and tear from use (i.e., it’s folded or creased due to frequent handling).
3. The clock doesn’t work; the desk lamp can’t be charged, and it can’t be used either. Additionally, it’s impossible to adjust the time.
4. Contact Amazon customer service separately; you will have to pay the shipping costs to send the item to the United States out of your own pocket, and then the additional shipping fees will be reimbursed later.
The reason for the scores of 5 and 2 is that the customer service is quite good.
The first time I bought something, it had problems; all the lights were flashing and not working.
To request a refund, it took three days to get the goods to Shanghai and they still haven't been delivered.
They don’t even answer the phone when you call them to arrange delivery.
The courier company says they have that contact information only.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
No request was made; however, in the case of a delayed delivery, they inexplicably delayed the delivery according to my request – and then this kind of message was sent to me.
Then they talked about some transfer issues again.
The company's website, which is owned by Amazon, says that the company's customers are "not happy with the poor shopping experience and are beginning to question the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics and control systems".
I don’t think I’ll be able to get it today either.
